---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '@/assets/about-portrait.png';
import AboutButton from '@/components/about/AboutButton.astro';
---

<section class="grid items-center gap-10 pb-14 pt-12 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_220px] lg:gap-16 lg:pb-20">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-acid uppercase">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-acid"></span>
      Empresario tecnológico · Consultor digital
    </p>

    <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-2xl font-sans text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.045em] text-bone sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.5rem]">
      Que la tecnología resuelva algo importante para tu negocio.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base font-light leading-7 text-smoke sm:text-lg sm:leading-8">
      Ayudo a empresas y profesionales a ordenar sus retos digitales y convertirlos en proyectos concretos: presencia web, automatización e inteligencia artificial aplicada con criterio.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-7 grid w-full max-w-xl gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <AboutButton href="https://calendly.com/juanmaldonadopolo/30min" newTab fullWidth variant="primary">Hablemos de tu proyecto</AboutButton>
      <AboutButton href="#enfoque" fullWidth variant="secondary">Ver áreas de trabajo</AboutButton>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Primera conversación de 30 minutos, sin costo ni compromiso.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="group relative mx-auto flex w-36 flex-col sm:w-40 lg:w-48">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-2 rotate-3 rounded-2xl border border-acid/25 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-0 motion-reduce:transition-none"></div>
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-steel bg-graphite p-1.5 shadow-xl shadow-black/25">
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Juan Maldonado en un retrato de estudio"
        width={320}
        height={400}
        format="webp"
        quality={78}
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-lg object-cover object-center"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-center font-sans text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-smoke uppercase">Tecnología + negocio</p>
  </div>
</section>
